1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,100
The next morning, Leo came back for the jacket.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:06,000
But it was gone.

3
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:09,428
Something had dragged it away.

4
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:16,905
Then a carrot began to float.

5
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:21,400
Leo knew that trick.

6
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:24,281
Someone else had found the jacket.
